{
  "name": "Celestial Revelation",
  "type": "feat",
  "_id": "6znqdmQCKulUtFpm",
  "img": "icons/magic/holy/projectiles-blades-salvo-yellow.webp",
  "folder": "DDzRPAzf061t1UGK",
  "sort": 400000,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at character level 3, you can transform as a Bonus Action, choosing one of the options below each time. The transformation lasts 1 minute or until you end it (no action required). Once you transform, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><p>Once on each of your turns until the transformation ends, when you deal damage to a target with an attack or a spell, you can deal extra damage to it equal to your Proficiency Bonus: Necrotic for Necrotic Shroud, Radiant for Heavenly Wings and Inner Radiance.</p><p><strong>Heavenly Wings.</strong> Two spectral wings sprout from your back. Until the transformation ends, you have a Fly Speed equal to your Speed.</p><p><strong>Inner Radiance.</strong> Searing light shines from your eyes and mouth. For the duration, you shed Bright Light in a 10-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 10 feet, and at the end of each of your turns, each creature within 10 feet of you takes Radiant damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus.</p><p><strong>Necrotic Shroud.</strong> Your eyes turn into pools of darkness, and flightless wings sprout from your back. Each creature other than your allies within 10 feet of you must succeed on a Charisma saving throw (DC 8 plus your Charisma modifier and Proficiency Bonus) or have the &amp;Reference[Frightened] condition until the end of your next turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-OOG5lKnk1kh79eKN\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Each transformation activity spends the use and applies its effect (the Fly Speed of Heavenly Wings is automated). <em>Revelation Damage</em> rolls the extra damage, once per turn; <em>Radiance Burst</em> rolls the Inner Radiance damage at the end of each of your turns.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
